    <string name="about_presentation_script_title">5–7 Minute Clinical Coordination Walkthrough</string>
    <string name="about_presentation_script_body">1. Patient: open Heart Failure episode, confirm morning meds, and submit elevated BP (172/104 mmHg).\n2. Family: review triggered alert guidance and escalate on behalf of the patient.\n3. Nurse: triage queue, send vitals recheck + clinical note, and escalate to Physician.\n4. Physician: inspect clinical sheet, amend Care Plan with evening weight check, and sign off v2.\n5. EHR Sync: toggle HTTP 409 Conflict, push observations, reconcile conflict, and sync.\n6. Language: switch EN → pt-BR / es / fr live without leaving the episode.</string>
